{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12760","headline":"华清宫 · 张继","name":"华清宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天宝承平奈乐何，华清宫殿郁嵯峩。\n朝元阁峻临秦岭，羯鼓楼高俯渭河。\n玉树长飘云外曲，霓裳闲舞月中歌。\n只今惟有温泉水，呜咽声中感慨多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}